WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.100
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.414
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:17.116
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:18.826
Resume complete.

00:00:18.826 --> 00:00:24.256
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:24.256 --> 00:00:29.400
Read-only replay.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.467
Back live. Paused.
